WEBVTT

00:02:59.455 --> 00:03:00.596
(Laughter)

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:01.921
(Audience: Wow.)

00:03:02.892 --> 00:03:04.582
Another example is closer to home.

00:03:04.606 --> 00:03:07.464
So millions of people
across the United States and the world

00:03:07.488 --> 00:03:09.776
are adopting so-called
"smart home" devices,

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:12.363
like internet-connected
surveillance cameras.

00:03:12.712 --> 00:03:15.974
But we know that any technology
connected to the internet

00:03:15.998 --> 00:03:17.148
can be hacked.

00:03:18.514 --> 00:03:20.228
And so if a hacker

00:03:20.252 --> 00:03:23.554
gets into your internet-connected
surveillance camera at home,

00:03:23.578 --> 00:03:26.276
they can watch you
and your family coming and going,

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.748
finding just the right time to strike.

00:03:29.553 --> 00:03:31.862
You know what can't be hacked remotely?